r\n * Bug Report\r\n\r\n##### COMPONENT NAME\r\n~~~\r\nAPI via cmk\r\n~~~\r\n\r\n##### CLOUDSTACK VERSION\r\n~~~\r\n4.17.0.1\r\n~~~\r\n\r\n##### CONFIGURATION\r\nN/A\r\n\r\n\r\n##### OS / ENVIRONMENT\r\nN/A\r\n\r\n\r\n##### SUMMARY\r\n<!-- Explain the problem/feature briefly -->\r\n\r\n\r\n##### STEPS TO REPRODUCE\r\n~~~\r\nstep1: add user, add password for this user, play with this user.\r\nstep2: enable SAML SSO authentication for this user, either by webui or API\r\nstep3: When you choose to remove the SAML SSO authentication, via cmk : authorize samlsso enable=false userid=myuser id\r\nstep4: Try to login on webui with failure :)\r\n~~~\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n##### EXPECTED RESULTS\r\nUser should be able to login on cloudstack web UI\r\nWhen SSO is disable the field \"source\" on user table is SAML2DISABLED\r\nWhen SSO has never been activated (and user is able to login via cloudstack directly) this field must be UNKNOWN.\r\n\r\n##### ACTUAL RESULTS\r\nUser can't login on cloudstack web UI\r\n","comments":5,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/apache/cloudstack/issues/6672/comments","created_at":"2022-08-24T16:23:19Z","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/apache/cloudstack/issues/6672/events","html_url":"https://github.com/apache/cloudstack/issues/6672","id":1349721393,"labels":[{"color":"a5f9ff","default":false,"description":"","id":817420428,"name":"type:improvement","node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw4MTc0MjA0Mjg=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/apache/cloudstack/labels/type:improvement"}],"labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/apache/cloudstack/issues/6672/labels{/name}","locked":false,"milestone":{"closed_issues":112,"created_at":"2026-04-13T07:02:43Z","creator":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/12028987?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sureshanaparti/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sureshanaparti/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sureshanaparti/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sureshanaparti/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/sureshanaparti","id":12028987,"login":"sureshanaparti","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyMDI4OTg3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sureshanaparti/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sureshanaparti/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sureshanaparti/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sureshanaparti/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sureshanaparti/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sureshanaparti"},"description":"","html_url":"https://github.com/apache/cloudstack/milestone/46","id":15514689,"labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/apache/cloudstack/milestones/46/labels","node_id":"MI_kwDOAJTq2M4A7LxB","number":46,"open_issues":253,"state":"open","title":"4.22.2","updated_at":"2026-09-28T10:46:21Z","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/apache/cloudstack/milestones/46"},"node_id":"I_kwDOAJTq2M5Qcx0x","number":6672,"reactions":{"+1":0,"-1":0,"confused":0,"eyes":0,"heart":0,"hooray":0,"laugh":0,"rocket":0,"total_count":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/apache/cloudstack/issues/6672/reactions"},"repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/apache/cloudstack","state":"open","title":"After removing SAML auth, user should be able to login via password directly","type":{"color":"blue","created_at":"2024-01-25T09:11:09Z","description":"A request, idea, or new functionality","id":93574,"name":"Feature","node_id":"IT_kwDNuP_OAAFthg","updated_at":"2024-10-08T08:30:20Z"},"updated_at":"2026-04-24T11:42:51Z","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/apache/cloudstack/issues/6672","user":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/800433?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atmaniak/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atmaniak/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atmaniak/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atmaniak/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/atmaniak","id":800433,"login":"atmaniak","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgwMDQzMw==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atmaniak/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atmaniak/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atmaniak/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atmaniak/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atmaniak/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/atmaniak"}},{"author_association":"NONE","body":"<!--\r\nVerify first that your issue/request is not already reported on GitHub.\r\nAlso test if the latest release and main branch are affected too.\r\nAlways add information AFTER of these HTML comments, but no need to delete the comments.\r\n-->\r\n\r\n##### ISSUE TYPE\r\n<!-- Pick one below and delete the rest -->\r\n\r\n * Feature Idea\r\n\r\n\r\n##### COMPONENT NAME\r\n<!--\r\nCategorize the issue, e.g. API, VR, VPN, UI, etc.\r\n-->\r\n~~~\r\nUI\r\n~~~\r\n\r\n##### CLOUDSTACK VERSION\r\n<!--\r\nNew line separated list of affected versions, commit ID for issues on main branch.\r\n-->\r\n\r\n~~~\r\n4.17.0.1\r\n~~~\r\n\r\n##### CONFIGURATION\r\n<!--\r\nInformation about the configuration if relevant, e.g. basic network, advanced networking, etc.  N/A otherwise\r\n-->\r\nN/A\r\n\r\n##### OS / ENVIRONMENT\r\n<!--\r\nInformation about the environment if relevant, N/A otherwise\r\n-->\r\nN/A\r\n\r\n##### SUMMARY\r\n<!-- Explain the problem/feature briefly -->\r\nI would like to have a \"counter\" in the UI showing the time until the current session is closed and the user needs to authenticate again. In addition a button to \"refresh\" the session / restart the session time-out would be quite convenient.\r\nFor positioning i would suggest to place this in the top menue right beside the username and button for changeing the language-settings\r\n\r\n![Screenshot 2022-09-05 183408](https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/79725167/188490112-f261b42c-fa62-4957-add2-8583f245a643.jpg)\r\n\r\n\r\n##### STEPS TO REPRODUCE\r\n<!--\r\nFor bugs, show exactly how to reproduce the problem, using a minimal test-case. Use Screenshots if accurate.\r\n\r\nFor new features, show how the feature would be used.\r\n-->\r\n\r\n<!-- Paste example playbooks or commands between quotes below -->\r\n~~~\r\n\r\n~~~\r\n\r\n<!-- You can also paste gist.github.com links for larger files -->\r\n\r\n##### EXPECTED RESULTS\r\n<!-- What did you expect to happen when running the steps above? -->\r\n\r\n~~~\r\n\r\n~~~\r\n\r\n##### ACTUAL RESULTS\r\n<!-- What actually happened? -->\r\n\r\n<!-- Paste verbatim command output between quotes below -->\r\n~~~\r\n\r\n~~~\r\n","comments":9,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/apache/cloudstack/issues/6703/comments","created_at":"2022-09-05T16:35:54Z","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/apache/cloudstack/issues/6703/events","html_url":"https://github.com/apache/cloudstack/issues/6703","id":1362269910,"labels":[{"color":"E43179","default":false,"description":"","id":6890295339,"name":"status:stale","node_id":"LA_kwDOAJTq2M8AAAABmrGQKw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/apache/cloudstack/labels/status:stale"}],"labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/apache/cloudstack/issues/6703/labels{/name}","locked":false,"milestone":{"closed_issues":1302,"created_at":"2021-01-04T09:07:50Z","creator":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2486961?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DaanHoogland/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DaanHoogland/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DaanHoogland/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DaanHoogland/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/DaanHoogland","id":2486961,"login":"DaanHoogland","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI0ODY5NjE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DaanHoogland/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DaanHoogland/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DaanHoogland/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DaanHoogland/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DaanHoogland/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DaanHoogland"},"html_url":"https://github.com/apache/cloudstack/milestone/19","id":6265435,"labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/apache/cloudstack/milestones/19/labels","node_id":"MDk6TWlsZXN0b25lNjI2NTQzNQ==","number":19,"open_issues":185,"state":"open","title":"unplanned","updated_at":"2026-09-24T11:01:33Z","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/apache/cloudstack/milestones/19"},"node_id":"I_kwDOAJTq2M5RMpbW","number":6703,"reactions":{"+1":0,"-1":0,"confused":0,"eyes":0,"heart":0,"hooray":0,"laugh":0,"rocket":0,"total_count":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/apache/cloudstack/issues/6703/reactions"},"repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/apache/cloudstack","state":"open","title":"Introduce a \"session timeout\" counter in GUI","updated_at":"2026-05-26T10:57:21Z","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/apache/cloudstack/issues/6703","user":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/79725167?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hudratronium/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hudratronium/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hudratronium/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hudratronium/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Hudratronium","id":79725167,"login":"Hudratronium","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc5NzI1MTY3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hudratronium/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hudratronium/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hudratronium/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hudratronium/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hudratronium/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hudratronium"}},{"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","body":"Hi,\r\n\r\nIf I configure the Prometheus exporter to allow requests from ::1 (ipv6 localhost, short form) it doesn't actually honour requests.\r\n\r\nIn the logs you can see entries such as:\r\n```Prometheus exporter received client request from: 0:0:0:0:0:0:0:1```\r\n\r\nIndeed, once you add 0:0:0:0:0:0:0:1 (ipv6 localhost, medium form) it starts working.\r\n\r\nIt's a minor issue, but nice to get sorted as most people are used to ::1.","comments":3,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/apache/cloudstack/issues/6714/comments","created_at":"2022-09-07T15:18:25Z","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/apache/cloudstack/issues/6714/events","html_url":"https://github.com/apache/cloudstack/issues/6714","id":1364832398,"labels":[{"color":"fc2929","default":false,"description":"","id":37843364,"name":"type:bug","node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwzNzg0MzM2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/apache/cloudstack/labels/type:bug"},{"color":"e08888","default":false,"description":"","id":1391967979,"name":"Severity:Trivial","node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxMzkxOTY3OTc5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/apache/cloudstack/labels/Severity:Trivial"},{"color":"C744C9","default":false,"description":"","id":4507982790,"name":"ipv6","node_id":"LA_kwDOAJTq2M8AAAABDLJbxg","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/apache/cloudstack/labels/ipv6"},{"color":"E265FC","default":false,"description":"","id":5651870091,"name":"component:prometheus","node_id":"LA_kwDOAJTq2M8AAAABUOCxiw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/apache/cloudstack/labels/component:prometheus"},{"color":"E43179","default":false,"description":"","id":6890295339,"name":"status:stale","node_id":"LA_kwDOAJTq2M8AAAABmrGQKw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/apache/cloudstack/labels/status:stale"}],"labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/apache/cloudstack/issues/6714/labels{/name}","locked":false,"milestone":{"closed_issues":112,"created_at":"2026-04-13T07:02:43Z","creator":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/12028987?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sureshanaparti/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sureshanaparti/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sureshanaparti/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sureshanaparti/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/sureshanaparti","id":12028987,"login":"sureshanaparti","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyMDI4OTg3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sureshanaparti/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sureshanaparti/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sureshanaparti/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sureshanaparti/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sureshanaparti/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sureshanaparti"},"description":"","html_url":"https://github.com/apache/cloudstack/milestone/46","id":15514689,"labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/apache/cloudstack/milestones/46/labels","node_id":"MI_kwDOAJTq2M4A7LxB","number":46,"open_issues":253,"state":"open","title":"4.22.2","updated_at":"2026-09-28T10:46:21Z","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/apache/cloudstack/milestones/46"},"node_id":"I_kwDOAJTq2M5RWbCO","number":6714,"reactions":{"+1":0,"-1":0,"confused":0,"eyes":0,"heart":0,"hooray":0,"laugh":0,"rocket":0,"total_count":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/apache/cloudstack/issues/6714/reactions"},"repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/apache/cloudstack","state":"open","title":"Prometheus exporter - interpret ::1 as 0:0:0:0:0:0:0:1","updated_at":"2026-06-29T08:38:57Z","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/apache/cloudstack/issues/6714","user":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2357012?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NuxRo/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NuxRo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NuxRo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NuxRo/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/NuxRo","id":2357012,"login":"NuxRo","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzNTcwMTI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NuxRo/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NuxRo/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NuxRo/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NuxRo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NuxRo/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/NuxRo"}},{"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","body":"##### ISSUE TYPE\r\n * Bug Report\r\n\r\n##### COMPONENT NAME\r\n~~~\r\nManagement, Network, SystemVM\r\n~~~\r\n\r\n##### CLOUDSTACK VERSION\r\n~~~\r\n4.16.1\r\n~~~\r\n\r\n##### CONFIGURATION\r\nIn database:\r\n```\r\nMariaDB [cloud]> select name,value from configuration where name = 'control.cidr';\r\n+--------------+------------------+\r\n| name         | value            |\r\n+--------------+------------------+\r\n| control.cidr | 169.254.240.0/20 |\r\n+--------------+------------------+\r\nMariaDB [cloud]> select name,value from configuration where name = 'control.gateway';\r\n+-----------------+---------------+\r\n| name            | value         |\r\n+-----------------+---------------+\r\n| control.gateway | 169.254.240.1 |\r\n+-----------------+---------------+\r\nMariaDB [cloud]> select count(*) from op_dc_link_local_ip_address_alloc;\r\n+----------+\r\n| count(*) |\r\n+----------+\r\n|    65533 |\r\n+----------+\r\n```\r\nOn agent:\r\n```\r\nroot@hv-04-02-21:~# grep control.cidr /etc/cloudstack/agent/agent.properties\r\ncontrol.cidr=169.254.240.0/20\r\n```\r\n\r\n##### SUMMARY\r\nWhen having set a `control.cidr` different from the norm (`168.254.0.0/16`) and the database table `op_dc_link_local_ip_address_alloc` is already populated with all the addresses in the default CIDR, then allocating an IP to a System VM does not take into account the requested CIDR, thus allocating an IP address in the wrong range.\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/apache/cloudstack/blob/main/engine/schema/src/main/java/com/cloud/dc/dao/DataCenterLinkLocalIpAddressDaoImpl.java#L52 should take this into account. This function is called in https://github.com/apache/cloudstack/blob/main/server/src/main/java/com/cloud/network/guru/ControlNetworkGuru.java#L134\r\n\r\n##### STEPS TO REPRODUCE\r\n- Install new management server\r\n- After kickstart, disable the zone to prevent any system vm deploys\r\n- In mysql database: `select count(*) from op_dc_link_local_ip_address_alloc;`, it would return `65533`\r\n- Connect agents\r\n- Configure `control.cidr` on the manager and agents, and `control.gateway` on the manager, ie:\r\n```\r\ncontrol.cidr=169.254.240.0/20\r\ncontrol.gateway=169.254.240.1\r\n```\r\n- Enable the zone, check the system vm link local address\r\n\r\n##### EXPECTED RESULTS\r\n- The System VMs should receive an IP address in the configured CIDR.\r\n- Additional expected: In mysql database: `select count(*) from op_dc_link_local_ip_address_alloc;`, it should return `4093`\r\n\r\n##### ACTUAL RESULTS\r\n- System VMs receive an IP address in the default `169.254.0.0/16` range\r\n```\r\n2022-09-07 22:45:35,338 DEBUG [o.a.c.e.o.NetworkOrchestrator] (Work-Job-Executor-3:ctx-b1c76634 job-149/job-150 ctx-224681ec) (logid:32608415) Network id=201 is already implemented\r\n2022-09-07 22:45:35,524 DEBUG [c.c.n.g.ControlNetworkGuru] (Work-Job-Executor-3:ctx-b1c76634 job-149/job-150 ctx-224681ec) (logid:32608415) Reserved NIC for v-18-VM [ipv4:169.254.167.69 netmask:255.255.240.0 gateway:169.254.240.1]\r\n```\r\n","comments":2,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/apache/cloudstack/issues/6715/comments","created_at":"2022-09-08T08:18:52Z","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/apache/cloudstack/issues/6715/events","html_url":"https://github.com/apache/cloudstack/issues/6715","id":1365767365,"labels":[{"color":"006b75","default":false,"description":"","id":584072971,"name":"component:kvm","node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw1ODQwNzI5NzE=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/apache/cloudstack/labels/component:kvm"},{"color":"f9d0c4","default":false,"description":"","id":592559219,"name":"component:networking","node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw1OTI1NTkyMTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/apache/cloudstack/labels/component:networking"},{"color":"906666","default":false,"description":"","id":1391968610,"name":"Severity:Minor","node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxMzkxOTY4NjEw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/apache/cloudstack/labels/Severity:Minor"},{"color":"906C28","default":false,"description":"","id":2694797573,"name":"status:needs-investigation","node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNjk0Nzk3NTcz","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/apache/cloudstack/labels/status:needs-investigation"},{"color":"E43179","default":false,"description":"","id":6890295339,"name":"status:stale","node_id":"LA_kwDOAJTq2M8AAAABmrGQKw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/apache/cloudstack/labels/status:stale"},{"color":"ededed","default":false,"id":9849008471,"name":"no-issue-activity","node_id":"LA_kwDOAJTq2M8AAAACSwvxVw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/apache/cloudstack/labels/no-issue-activity"}],"labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/apache/cloudstack/issues/6715/labels{/name}","locked":false,"milestone":{"closed_issues":1302,"created_at":"2021-01-04T09:07:50Z","creator":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2486961?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DaanHoogland/events{/privacy}"